Root cause: Not reproducible—no persistent fault found; the earlier issue may have been a transient condition that has since cleared, but there is no current evidence of link or control-plane failure.

Corrective fix: No action required at this time. Recommend the user re-test, and we will continue to monitor. If the issue recurs, capture timestamps and we will pull device interface counters and BGP logs around the event to pinpoint any transient link flaps or neighbor resets. === END ===